520 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Flowchart illustrating a three-step process: Step 1 involves an interdisciplinary workshop with researchers discussing methods and aligning with UN SDGs. Step 2 includes field visits with local residents and association members for interviews and focus group discussions. Step 3 features a focus group across six countries for reflective discussion and analysis. Arrows lead from Discover to Define, Develop, and Deliver, with annotations like "Structural Translation of Results" and "Policy Reflections Pending." Meta-level reflections are noted in the final step.) /K 545 0 R /P 220 0 R /Pg 212 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
521 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Diagram illustrating a double diamond model of policy processes. The first diamond, labeled "Need driven LL policy process," includes "Discover Rural needs" and "Define Rural needs". The second, labeled "Institutional LL policy process," includes "Rural digital co-creating solutions" and "Rural policy recommendations". Arrows indicate stages: Discover, Define, Co-create, and Deliver, with a focus on future research. Dotted lines suggest interconnectedness between need-driven and institutional processes.) /K 546 0 R /P 220 0 R /Pg 215 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
